NOW THEREFORE, I, through this legal notice, on behalf of and under instructions from my Client, call upon you to, within 15 (fifteen) days of receipt of this notice:

(a) pay to my Client the outstanding arrears of rent amounting to Rs. 96,000/- (Rupees Ninety-Six Thousand only), being rent for May, June and July 2026;

(b) pay to my Client interest on the said arrears at such rate as may be lawfully due under the Indian Contract Act, 1872 and/or the Lease Agreement, from the respective dates the said rent fell due till the date of actual payment;

(c) pay to my Client mesne profits and/or damages for use and occupation of the tenanted premises at the rate of Rs. 32,000/- (Rupees Thirty-Two Thousand only) per month, or pro rata for any part thereof, for the period from the date of determination of the tenancy stated above until the date of delivery of vacant and peaceful possession of the tenanted premises;

(d) deliver vacant and peaceful possession of the tenanted premises to my Client on the expiry of the period of determination stated above; and

(e) pay to my Client a sum of Rs. 5,500/- (Rupees Five Thousand Five Hundred only) towards the cost of this legal notice.
